# ToastPanel

## Basic Usage

### ToastPanel

:::TuffDemoWrapper{demo="ToastPanelToastPanelDemo" code-lang="vue" title="An item surfacing" description="The tether links the new item to the list it came from; press Replay to watch it arrive."}
---
code: |
  <script setup lang="ts">
  import { ref } from 'vue'

  const open = ref(true)
  </script>

  <template>
    <TxToastPanel :open="open" :stack="1" aria-label="Latest signal">
      <!-- Content comes entirely from the host -->
      <div class="row">Theo Morgan · Pioneer Cloud</div>
    </TxToastPanel>
  </template>
---
